  "title": "AXIL Unveils MX II Next Generation Earmuffs Featuring Advanced SonicShieldX™ Technology",
  "summary": "Los Angeles, CA – December 18, 2025 – AXIL Brands, Inc. (NYSE American: AXIL), a leading innovator in hearing protection, enhancement, and audio technology, is excited to announce the upcoming launch of the MX II Series earmuffs. The MX II introduces the company's cutting-edge next-generation SonicShieldX™ technology platform, delivering superior hearing protection, sound enhancement, and unmatched comfort for outdoor enthusiasts and professionals in high-noise environments.",
